<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?><?xml-stylesheet href="http://www.blogger.com/styles/atom.css" type="text/css"?><feed xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom' xmlns:openSearch='http://a9.com/-/spec/opensearchrss/1.0/' xmlns:gd="http://schemas.google.com/g/2005"><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post1327629753440279418..comments</id><updated>2017-04-13T04:47:21.148-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Comments on Pro Libertate: Obama and the &quot;Predator Left&quot;</title><link rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#feed' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/feeds/comments/default'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1327629753440279418/comments/default'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/10/obama-and-predator-left.html'/><link rel="hub" href="http://pubsubhubbub.appspot.com/"/><link rel='next' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1327629753440279418/comments/default?start-index=26&amp;max-results=25'/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='19' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-5rhFUXs_62I/VgVL2E3rMII/AAAAAAAAMJ4/cjJOyI7W208/s220/Photo%2BRon%2BPaul%2BLiberty%2BReport.jpg'/></author><generator version='7.00' uri='http://www.blogger.com'>Blogger</generator><openSearch:totalResults>26</openSearch:totalResults><openSearch:startIndex>1</openSearch:startIndex><openSearch:itemsPerPage>25</openSearch:itemsPerPage><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8762134977743983484</id><published>2009-11-03T16:29:51.495-07:00</published><updated>2009-11-03T16:29:51.495-07:00</updated><title type='text'>anonymous @ 7:45 AM&#xa;&#xa;Very well-stated. Liberty/Ord...</title><content type='html'>anonymous @ 7:45 AM&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Very well-stated. Liberty/Order is the real conundrum of human relations and governance, indeed.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I&amp;#39;ve mentioned self-government in the past, but without the biblical references, and you put a proper and more concise perspective on it.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1327629753440279418/comments/default/8762134977743983484'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1327629753440279418/comments/default/8762134977743983484'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/10/obama-and-predator-left.html?showComment=1257290991495#c8762134977743983484' title=''/><author><name>dixiedog</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/09845646940134894119</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='31' height='32' src='http://members.cox.net/ogdenwb/images/dixiedog1_0508.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/10/obama-and-predator-left.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1327629753440279418' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1327629753440279418' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-504942784"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 3, 2009 at 4:29 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2453437493893387456</id><published>2009-11-02T14:03:20.398-07:00</published><updated>2009-11-02T14:03:20.398-07:00</updated><title type='text'>MoT, Gotcha. I should have known you were up on th...</title><content type='html'>MoT, Gotcha. I should have known you were up on the topic considering your commenting history. But for those who &lt;i&gt;don&amp;#39;t&lt;/i&gt; know the who-what-when-where* of modern education, Gatto&amp;#39;s book will be an eye-opener.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;*the why should be pretty obvious</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1327629753440279418/comments/default/2453437493893387456'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1327629753440279418/comments/default/2453437493893387456'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/10/obama-and-predator-left.html?showComment=1257195800398#c2453437493893387456' title=''/><author><name>Isaac Stanfield</name><uri>http://www.backyardguitars.wordpress.com</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/10/obama-and-predator-left.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1327629753440279418' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1327629753440279418' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-84170395"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 2, 2009 at 2:03 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2148348960884014102</id><published>2009-11-02T07:36:51.959-07:00</published><updated>2009-11-02T07:36:51.959-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Excellent point, petkov.  Delusion and idolatry ha...</title><content type='html'>Excellent point, petkov.  Delusion and idolatry have been the way of things since as far back as the founding of the USA and much farther.  It&amp;#39;s not a new phenomenon.  The veneration of so-called &amp;quot;Founding Fathers&amp;quot; (what self-respecting man would utter such a thing?) has everywhere been a necessary propaganda tool to ensure cohesiveness and perpetuate the myth of state.  &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Allegiance to a global super-state will be just as silly, of course, if not more so than loyalty to the waning nation-state.  But that doesn&amp;#39;t make nationalism a valid, sacrosanct reference point.  There are no true reference points.  There are no bedrock political principles worth adhering to.  Politics is hocus-pocus from jump and nothing more.  &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Everything in this world revolves around POWER RELATIONSHIPS, and the rest is illusion.  Globalism is simply the newest fleeting fad.  This, too, will fail to usher in the elusive Heaven on Earth.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;We are wandering around in circles here in the desert, chasing in vain after countless mirages.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1327629753440279418/comments/default/2148348960884014102'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1327629753440279418/comments/default/2148348960884014102'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/10/obama-and-predator-left.html?showComment=1257172611959#c2148348960884014102' title=''/><author><name>Marcus Pessimisticus</name><uri>http://www.misanthropemuses.com</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/10/obama-and-predator-left.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1327629753440279418' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1327629753440279418' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-816872073"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 2, 2009 at 7:36 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3080552397579382408</id><published>2009-11-01T21:59:45.077-07:00</published><updated>2009-11-01T21:59:45.077-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Two legs bad, four legs good. Same as it ever was....</title><content type='html'>Two legs bad, four legs good. Same as it ever was.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1327629753440279418/comments/default/3080552397579382408'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1327629753440279418/comments/default/3080552397579382408'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/10/obama-and-predator-left.html?showComment=1257137985077#c3080552397579382408' title=''/><author><name>Eric Blair</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/10/obama-and-predator-left.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1327629753440279418' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1327629753440279418' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1657992643"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 1, 2009 at 9:59 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2566741646386548842</id><published>2009-11-01T19:07:59.502-07:00</published><updated>2009-11-01T19:07:59.502-07:00</updated><title type='text'>&amp;quot;MoT,&#xa;John Taylor Gatto has an interesting bo...</title><content type='html'>&amp;quot;MoT,&lt;br /&gt;John Taylor Gatto has an interesting book...&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Isaac, thanks for the reference.  I know JTG and couldn&amp;#39;t agree with you more.  I should mention that much of what I say, and probably a majority of posters here, have that very big tongue in cheek.  Wink wink nudge nudge say no more.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1327629753440279418/comments/default/2566741646386548842'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1327629753440279418/comments/default/2566741646386548842'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/10/obama-and-predator-left.html?showComment=1257127679502#c2566741646386548842' title=''/><author><name>MoT</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/13996714804361467430</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='23' src='http://bp3.blogger.com/_RPImowXMSuQ/SBjAjbSgPQI/AAAAAAAAABA/THgfv851ckU/S220/amsoc.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/10/obama-and-predator-left.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1327629753440279418' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1327629753440279418' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-388975791"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 1, 2009 at 7:07 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-18032131788531674</id><published>2009-11-01T17:49:47.693-07:00</published><updated>2009-11-01T17:49:47.693-07:00</updated><title type='text'>wow...  &#xa;&#xa;you&amp;#39;re going in my favorites.</title><content type='html'>wow...  &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;you&amp;#39;re going in my favorites.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1327629753440279418/comments/default/18032131788531674'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1327629753440279418/comments/default/18032131788531674'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/10/obama-and-predator-left.html?showComment=1257122987693#c18032131788531674' title=''/><author><name>shel</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/17051812539957590906</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='26' height='32' src='http://bp2.blogger.com/_tzjL6ce4lIE/SAqr8sSoztI/AAAAAAAAACA/sLwGBUg5oUo/S220/00460001.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/10/obama-and-predator-left.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1327629753440279418' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1327629753440279418' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1782740745"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 1, 2009 at 5:49 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2356246892635709429</id><published>2009-11-01T17:40:18.674-07:00</published><updated>2009-11-01T17:40:18.674-07:00</updated><title type='text'>MoT,&#xa;John Taylor Gatto has an interesting book cal...</title><content type='html'>MoT,&lt;br /&gt;John Taylor Gatto has an interesting book called &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.amazon.com/gp/product/0945700040/ref=ox_ya_oh_product&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;The Underground History of American Education&lt;/a&gt;.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1327629753440279418/comments/default/2356246892635709429'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1327629753440279418/comments/default/2356246892635709429'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/10/obama-and-predator-left.html?showComment=1257122418674#c2356246892635709429' title=''/><author><name>Isaac Stanfield</name><uri>http://www.backyardguitars.wordpress.com</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/10/obama-and-predator-left.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1327629753440279418' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1327629753440279418' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-2037236520"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 1, 2009 at 5:40 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5854056585338832144</id><published>2009-11-01T12:12:39.589-07:00</published><updated>2009-11-01T12:12:39.589-07:00</updated><title type='text'>This LRAD sounds suspiciously similar to Project X...</title><content type='html'>This LRAD sounds suspiciously similar to Project X from Atlas Shrugged, and is being used for the same purpose.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1327629753440279418/comments/default/5854056585338832144'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1327629753440279418/comments/default/5854056585338832144'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/10/obama-and-predator-left.html?showComment=1257102759589#c5854056585338832144' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/10/obama-and-predator-left.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1327629753440279418' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1327629753440279418' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-742401502"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 1, 2009 at 12:12 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1656426629601088513</id><published>2009-11-01T11:44:53.523-07:00</published><updated>2009-11-01T11:44:53.523-07:00</updated><title type='text'>unless the world&amp;#39;s largest egg-beater is firml...</title><content type='html'>unless the world&amp;#39;s largest egg-beater is firmly held by politically correct hands?&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Spilling a little yoke to scramble the eggs. Excellent choice of words Will. Sometimes you even out do yourself with some wit that cuts through the BS like no knife sharpness could ever do. Outstanding piece of work on this topic of government ordered murders. Lets hope this one is read my many.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1327629753440279418/comments/default/1656426629601088513'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1327629753440279418/comments/default/1656426629601088513'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/10/obama-and-predator-left.html?showComment=1257101093523#c1656426629601088513' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/10/obama-and-predator-left.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1327629753440279418' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1327629753440279418' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-2141679396"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 1, 2009 at 11:44 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5228673262795473812</id><published>2009-11-01T08:45:41.445-07:00</published><updated>2009-11-01T08:45:41.445-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Dear Will: &#xa;&#xa;Great article &amp;amp; comments, too.&#xa;&#xa;I...</title><content type='html'>Dear Will: &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Great article &amp;amp; comments, too.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I heartily appreciate your stimulating writing !  Thanks for keeping a jaundiced eye on the police state, fulltime.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The theme I keep thinking of that runs throughout your writing seems to be: How do we, as citizens, achieve the balancing act of blending Liberty with Order ?&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&amp;quot;Liberty without Order is as destructive as Order without Liberty&amp;quot;, a wise man remarked.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;This is the perpetual challenge, that is the province of Self-Government, under God, to discover, define &amp;amp; put into practice.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Which is why politics is the inevitable outcome of our First Principles, not the otherway &amp;#39;round.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;It&amp;#39;s the struggle to balance Liberty with Order that causes &amp;#39;Freedom&amp;#39;.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;It&amp;#39;s the refusal to blend the two that causes destruction.  &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;(Micah 6:8 holds the key ....)&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;For example, the Left&amp;#39;s besetting sin is to desire total Liberty, thus they neglect Order.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Contrarywise, the Right&amp;#39;s mirror-opposite error is to so seek total Order, that they destroy Liberty.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;As Petrov &amp;amp; Sam C pointed out, some men (Federalists), erred on the &amp;#39;Order, at the expense of Liberty&amp;#39; side.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;If the Anti-Federalists erred on the other side, at least that limited the potential abuse of Centralized power.  (As our age has PROVEN...)&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;But the requirement, the precondition of a more local form of Government is a stronger connection to God &amp;amp; His eternal Principles.......the more we enjoy of Self-Govenment, in this manner, the less need we will have to &amp;quot;ask for a King..&amp;quot; (I Samuel 8).&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;As William Penn observed:  &amp;quot;Men must either be governed by God, or they condemn themselves to be ruled by Tryants.&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The answer to all these police state fears is a return to Self-government: a governing of the Passions of individual men, by the only One capable of grounding them to an Ordered Liberty, without ever being tyrannical:   &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Jesus Christ, King of Kings &amp;amp; Lord of Lords. **  &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Either we repent, honor &amp;amp; obey Him, or be ruled by : Bush, Obama or the Federal &amp;amp; State tyrants.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;As for me &amp;amp; my house, we will serve the LORD !&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;David Alan&lt;br /&gt;Republic of Texas&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;**(The recognition of this truth, resulted in the Reformation &amp;amp; set the stage for America in the late 1500&amp;#39;s onward...Another chapter...)</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1327629753440279418/comments/default/5228673262795473812'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1327629753440279418/comments/default/5228673262795473812'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/10/obama-and-predator-left.html?showComment=1257090341445#c5228673262795473812' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/10/obama-and-predator-left.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1327629753440279418' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1327629753440279418' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-886040950"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 1, 2009 at 8:45 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3916408107531440613</id><published>2009-10-31T22:49:23.212-06:00</published><updated>2009-10-31T22:49:23.212-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Petkov makes a very cogent point  that gets lost t...</title><content type='html'>Petkov makes a very cogent point  that gets lost time and again in the &amp;quot;debate&amp;quot;.  I hear over and over people moaning about how there is the lack of civics classes in school and how the young are ignorant about the Constitution, history, etc.  Funny, but as I recall it was BECAUSE of these said civics classes that I was indoctrinated and kept ignorant of the truth.  It wasn&amp;#39;t because they happened to not be around but because they WERE, and the statist mindset they bred, that I didn&amp;#39;t see the world clearly until I was well into my thirties.  And how far back does this propaganda go?  When were its seeds planted?  Clearly well before I ever took my first breath.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1327629753440279418/comments/default/3916408107531440613'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1327629753440279418/comments/default/3916408107531440613'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/10/obama-and-predator-left.html?showComment=1257050963212#c3916408107531440613' title=''/><author><name>MoT</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/13996714804361467430</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://