but ultimately just annoying noise, we&amp;#39;ll eventually get introduced to its innards-liquefying high-power setting.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1327629753440279418/comments/default/2577654795696227584'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1327629753440279418/comments/default/2577654795696227584'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/10/obama-and-predator-left.html?showComment=1256943324307#c2577654795696227584' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/10/obama-and-predator-left.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1327629753440279418' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1327629753440279418' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1992922629"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 30, 2009 at 4:55 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3156757419733883592</id><published>2009-10-30T14:36:56.813-06:00</published><updated>2009-10-30T14:36:56.813-06:00</updated><title type='text'>That is neat you got to interview an actual pinko ...</title><content type='html'>That is neat you got to interview an actual pinko commie rat. Most psychopathic bureaucrat scum of the looter class are as inspiring as a burnt piece of toast. Nikita Kruschev would have been an interesting interview. Wasn&amp;#39;t the quote &amp;quot;When I go to hang the capitalist pig west someone from there will sell me the rope&amp;quot; attributed to him?</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1327629753440279418/comments/default/3156757419733883592'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1327629753440279418/comments/default/3156757419733883592'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/10/obama-and-predator-left.html?showComment=1256935016813#c3156757419733883592' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/10/obama-and-predator-left.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1327629753440279418' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1327629753440279418' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-153111413"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 30, 2009 at 2:36 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5225844859856611888</id><published>2009-10-30T14:35:01.587-06:00</published><updated>2009-10-30T14:35:01.587-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Petkov raises a good point. The seeds of the state...</title><content type='html'>Petkov raises a good point. The seeds of the state we see today go all the way back to the beginning of our Nation and the struggle between the Federalists and Anti-federalists. The fight between a big centralized government (espoused by Madison, Hamilton, and their ilk) and small decentralized government (supported by Patrick Henry, George Mason, and others) was lost when the Constitution was ratified by the States. We have sown the wind and reaped the whirlwind.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1327629753440279418/comments/default/5225844859856611888'/><link rel='self'