com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='31' height='13' src='http://bp3.blogger.com/_DJFdiJYKX2Y/R-VWHCcM2qI/AAAAAAAAATk/Tgw6srrhKx0/S220/TerryToons+02.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/10/obama-and-predator-left.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1327629753440279418' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1327629753440279418' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-758129297"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 30, 2009 at 9:51 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1020483649603269343</id><published>2009-10-30T06:22:01.704-06:00</published><updated>2009-10-30T06:22:01.704-06:00</updated><title type='text'>i imagine you can see that obama image for what it...</title><content type='html'>i imagine you can see that obama image for what it is, but just in case anyone missed it: that&amp;#39;s not just a &amp;quot;divine light&amp;quot; filter, that is &lt;a href=&quot;http://wroth.org/tmp/crown.jpg&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;a crown&lt;/a&gt;.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1327629753440279418/comments/default/1020483649603269343'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1327629753440279418/comments/default/1020483649603269343'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/10/obama-and-predator-left.html?showComment=1256905321704#c1020483649603269343' title=''/><author><name>jon</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/02615104086703717817</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='26' height='32' src='http://2.bp.blogspot.com/_A2qHhz-MI04/SnR7Xifpz6I/AAAAAAAAABw/HcVHLVCrzfk/S220/headshot.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/10/obama-and-predator-left.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1327629753440279418' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1327629753440279418' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1009637997"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 30, 2009 at 6:22 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8061178776229987447</id><published>2009-10-30T01:58:51.409-06:00</published><updated>2009-10-30T01:58:51.409-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Some of my favorite George Orwell insightful quota...</title><content type='html'>Some of my favorite George Orwell insightful quotations, which are excellent commentaries on parts this article:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&amp;quot;If liberty means anything at all, it means the right to tell people what they do not want to hear.&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&amp;quot;The Nationalist (One could include the rabid right-wing Republican - Gulliver...) not only does not disapprove of atrocities committed by his own side, but he has a remarkable capacity for not even hearing about them.&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&amp;quot;Doublethink means the power of holding two contradictory beliefs in one&amp;#39;s mind simultaneously, and accepting both of them.&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&amp;quot;War is a way of shattering to pieces, or pouring into the stratosphere, or sinking in the depths of the sea, materials which might otherwise be used to make the masses too comfortable, and hence, in the long run, too intelligent.&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&amp;quot;Political language -- and with variations this is true of all political parties, from Conservatives to Anarchists -- is designed to make lies sound truthful and murder respectable, and to give an appearance of solidity to pure wind.&amp;quot;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1327629753440279418/comments/default/8061178776229987447'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1327629753440279418/comments/default/8061178776229987447'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/10/obama-and-predator-left.html?showComment=1256889531409#c8061178776229987447' title=''/><author><name>Lemuel Gulliver</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/10/obama-and-predator-left.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1327629753440279418' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1327629753440279418' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1297910395"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 30, 2009 at 1:58 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5214276693154745433</id><published>2009-10-29T21:23:21.741-06:00</published><updated>2009-10-29T21:23:21.741-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Will, thanks for mentioning what Ted Rall wrote re...</title><content type='html'>Will, thanks for mentioning what Ted Rall wrote recently.  It only goes to prove what I&amp;#39;ve said time and again that some people have no problem being a slave so long as its &amp;quot;their&amp;quot; slave master that holds the whip.  It is this dysfunctional mindset that I run up against and I&amp;#39;m quite astonished as to how many people cling to it like a baby to their mothers teat.  &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;That weapons such as the LRAD would be used on peaceful protest within our own nation shows this country to be nothing less than a militarized state.  No need for a facade any longer.  Now it drops the mask and goes for your throat, or your ears, and pushes you out of the street.... YOUR streets even  simply to silence any dissent. Instead of just a Potemkin village we&amp;#39;re witness to a Potemkin nation.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1327629753440279418/comments/default/5214276693154745433'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1327629753440279418/comments/default/5214276693154745433'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/10/obama-and-predator-left.html?showComment=1256873001741#c5214276693154745433' title=''/><author><name>MoT</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/13996714804361467430</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='23' src='http://bp3.blogger.com/_RPImowXMSuQ/SBjAjbSgPQI/AAAAAAAAABA/THgfv851ckU/S220/amsoc.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/10/obama-and-predator-left.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1327629753440279418' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1327629753440279418' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-388975791"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 29, 2009 at 9:23 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7414409416589875821</id><published>2009-10-29T20:18:21.932-06:00</published><updated>2009-10-29T20:18:21.932-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Any idea how many predator drones are in the US?&#xa;&#xa;...</title><content type='html'>Any idea how many predator drones are in the US?&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;What an amazing tool for the thought police...</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+